# ML Models cache (optional - comment out if you want to track models).
# Pattern is `models/*` (not `models/`) so negation rules below can
# re-include specific committed model directories — git ignores
# negations under a fully-ignored parent.
models/*
# Exception: the wespeaker ONNX we ship is small (~27 MB) and built once
# from scripts/export_wespeaker_onnx.py — bundled with the .app, not
# downloaded at runtime. See models/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM-onnx/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md.
!models/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM-onnx/
.cache/huggingface/
.envrc.private
.DS_Store

